# launcher-enchants: from the menu, load the saved game setup/launcher-enchants writes (at
# (19, 51) on level 1, facing the door at (19, 53), with a crossbow of effect 3 (named "of
# Unsurpassed Accuracy", 7 damage by DoPlayerWeapon), a bow of effect 7 ("of Unsurpassed Damage",
# 7 to hit), crossbow bolts and arrows in the pack). Put the crossbow in the weapon hand and
# shoot two bolts at the door; put it back, take the bow and shoot two arrows. With the fix each
# bolt's damage before the dice is 7 more and each arrow's Missile-skill check is made at the
# skill plus 7; without it (the original: the same recording with its enhancements chunk naming
# skip-intro alone) the launchers add nothing. tools/launchercheck.py reads both from the
# missile probe
3000 key enter         # Journey Onward
4500 key enter         # the first saved game
8000 move 247 92    # the crossbow, from the pack into the weapon hand
8300 mdown 247 92 right
8600 move 247 66
8900 move 248 41
9200 mup 248 41 right
10400 key f1    # fight mode: the weapon drawn
11200 move 122 100
11900 mdown 122 100 right    # drawn until the gem is ready, then released in the view: a bolt at the door
13400 mup 122 100 right
14100 mdown 122 100 right
15600 mup 122 100 right
17100 key f1    # fight mode left
18300 move 248 41    # the crossbow back into the pack
18600 mdown 248 41 right
18900 move 247 66
19200 move 247 92
19500 mup 247 92 right
20700 move 265 92    # the bow into the weapon hand
21000 mdown 265 92 right
21300 move 256 66
21600 move 248 41
21900 mup 248 41 right
23100 key f1    # fight mode: the weapon drawn
23900 move 122 100
24600 mdown 122 100 right    # two arrows at the door
26100 mup 122 100 right
26800 mdown 122 100 right
28300 mup 122 100 right
29800 key f1    # fight mode left
